  unitName: Sword God Reed
  unitId: 10294
  unitNumber: 644
  description: A soldier who led many civilians to El Gaia during the last stages
    of the war with the gods. It is said that he continuously led the fights against
    the god army when fleeing with his people towards El Gaia. Because of his positive
    and indomitable spirit, many people gathered under him relying on his power,
    including both people from his hometown and many refugees from all other regions.
    And as if answering his prayers, the gods gifted him with more power to continue
    protecting the people.
  summonDesc: Leave the fighting to me!<br>I'll put my blade on the line<br>to protect
    you!
  fusionDesc: I wanna get stronger!<br>There are too many people out there<br>who
    still need my help!
  evoDesc: This is my new power!<br>The voices that cry for my help<br> make me stronger!
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
